# Imported AI history.
#
# Provider exports are among the most sensitive files a person owns, and a file
# committed once stays in git history forever. These rules exist so that a real
# ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini archive left in the working tree cannot be added by
# accident. Test fixtures are fabricated in code (app/tests/Support), never
# copied from a real export.
archives/
imports/
*-export.zip
*-export/
conversations.json
chat.html
message_feedback.json
model_comparisons.json
MyActivity.json
MyActivity.html
takeout*.zip
Takeout/
app/storage/app/openmemory-imports/
app/storage/app/openmemory-archives/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
